+// ---- q38 (TF_FLASHNEXT_Q38_LANE_REUSE=N): a released stream's fixed-size draft buffers wait here for the next stream ----
+// Each stream's Draft allocated ~45 fixed-size device buffers (the head's rows, scores, rollback copies, 36 spare DeltaNet states)
